      },
      {
        "event_id": "lite_evt_00483",
        "explanation": "The patient accepted and repeated that dose algorithm, making the closure traceable but unsafe.",
        "quote": "6以上就打甘精8个单位"
      }
    ],
    "executable": true,
    "explanation": "The patient had supplies, caregiver support, monitoring steps, and a concrete near-term endocrine follow-up plan, so the plan was executable and traceable. However, closure was unsafe because it rested on non-prescriber insulin dose adjustment and did not address the lung nodule follow-up thread that had become visible.",
